OL,3,GNEWSARetired hens seek new homes as
OL,4,Aadoption appeal takes off
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of retired hens will find new
OL,7,Fhomes this weekend after leaving
OL,8,Fcommercial egg farms.
OL,10,FThe adoption event at Rotherwas
OL,11,FIndustrial Estate in Hereford is being
OL,12,Forganised by the British Hen Welfare
OL,13,FTrust as part of a nationwide effort to
OL,14,Fgive retired hens a second chance at
OL,15,Flife, with 57 birds looking for new
OL,16,Fhomes.
OL,18,FEvery year thousands of chickens are
OL,19,Fretired from the industry as their
OL,20,Flaying productivity slows down, with
OL,21,Fmost of them only 18 months old.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
