OL,3,GNEWSARetired hens seek new homes as
OL,4,Aadoption appeal takes off
OL,5,
OL,6,FTraditionally, hens were sent for
OL,7,Fslaughter. However, since 2005, more
OL,8,Fthan a million hens have been saved and
OL,9,Frehomed in gardens, backyards and
OL,10,Fsmallholdings across the UK, including
OL,11,F40,682, this year alone.
